# Kayan aikin murɗawa: Liquify, Puppet Warp da Vanishing Point.

# Liquify
tool.liquify.name = Liquify
tool.liquify.description = Tura, murɗa, matse ko kumbura pixels da ke ƙarƙashin babban buroshi—zaɓin yanayi ne ke ƙayyade aikin. Murɗawar tana taruwa a raga sannan a yi amfani da ita a kan shimfiɗar lokacin tabbatarwa.
